(text "J1: stripped cable wires enter from TOP; solder on BOTTOM.\n1 BLACK = GND; 2 RED = 3V3; 3 YELLOW = SDA; 4 GREEN = SCL." (at 30 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid ccf30382-09c0-553a-9be8-3861fc943890))
(text "J2 female and J3 male: 2.54 mm pitch, four positions.\nJ4: JST PH, 2 mm pitch, through-hole, top entry.\nJ5: JST SH, 1 mm pitch, Qwiic, SMT on BOTTOM." (at 30 145 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 0c2ff649-c9fe-53b0-a411-862a58e1ba0c))
(text "All five pin-number mappings: 1=GND, 2=3V3, 3=SDA, 4=SCL.\nPH wiring is defined by this board; check the mating cable.\n3.3 V I2C only. No regulator, level shifter or added pull-ups.\nCheck cable continuity before power. Wire colors alone are not proof." (at 145 145 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 4a6bc6e7-57cb-5531-93d0-580f2631c900))
(text "26 x 16 mm. One copper layer: B.Cu. No vias or jumpers.\nLocal milling: 16 unplated solder holes, all solder joints on BOTTOM.\nCAM is mirrored once for machining BOTTOM copper face-up." (at 30 173 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 1425af2b-529d-51b4-b338-f88132444457))
)
